00:38:51.468 --> 00:38:53.758
Perhaps more than any other single person

1027
00:38:53.758 --> 00:38:56.487
beyond my wife and my kids.

1028
00:38:56.487 --> 00:38:58.500
He has had without knowing it,

1029
00:38:58.500 --> 00:39:02.305
an unbelievably profound impact on my journey,

1030
00:39:02.305 --> 00:39:03.900
on my career,

1031
00:39:03.900 --> 00:39:07.332
and how I think about and pursue self-expression.

1032
00:39:07.332 --> 00:39:09.290
His name is Steven Pressfield.

1033
00:39:09.290 --> 00:39:10.306
He's a novelist,

1034
00:39:10.306 --> 00:39:11.963
he's a screenwriter.

1035
00:39:11.963 --> 00:39:14.752
And the guy behind some of the most important nonfiction

1036
00:39:14.752 --> 00:39:16.933
books on creativity that I've ever read,

1037
00:39:16.933 --> 00:39:18.262
including of course,

1038
00:39:18.262 --> 00:39:19.527
"The War of Art,"

1039
00:39:19.527 --> 00:39:22.053
which you've likely heard me talk about quite frequently

1040
00:39:22.053 --> 00:39:23.679
on the podcast,

1041
00:39:23.679 --> 00:39:26.626
because it impacted me so deeply.

1042
00:39:26.626 --> 00:39:30.075
But chief among his many messages on creativity,

1043
00:39:30.075 --> 00:39:33.374
is a concept he calls resistance,

1044
00:39:33.374 --> 00:39:36.368
negative self-talk is such a prevalent part

1045
00:39:36.368 --> 00:39:37.864
of our mental lives

1046
00:39:37.864 --> 00:39:41.856
and can often lead to shame spirals of anxiety,

1047
00:39:41.856 --> 00:39:44.647
depression, self sabotage,

1048
00:39:44.647 --> 00:39:48.757
and ultimately self-harm or suicidal ideation.

1049
00:39:48.757 --> 00:39:52.926
And Steven shares his experience of how to suit up and win

1050
00:39:52.926 --> 00:39:56.256
this war against the negative force of resistance.

1051
00:39:56.256 --> 00:39:57.832
I hold this man and his work

1052
00:39:57.832 --> 00:40:00.113
in the absolute highest regard,

1053
00:40:00.113 --> 00:40:03.185
can't thank him enough for the gift of his contributions.

1054
00:40:03.185 --> 00:40:06.753
